---
import "../styles/components/newsletter.css";
---
<div class="nl">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="nl-inner rv">
      <div>
        <div class="section-label mb-3.5">订阅</div>
        <h2 class="nl-title">不错过每一篇<br><em>值得阅读的文章</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="nl-form">
        <p class="nl-copy">
          每月约 2-3 封邮件，只包含真正有价值的内容。无广告，可随时退订。
        </p>
        <div class="nl-row">
          <input class="nl-input" type="email" placeholder="your@email.com">
          <button class="nl-btn">订阅</button>
        </div>
        <p class="nl-meta">已有 847 位读者订阅</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
